cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this recipe, the engine, or its measurements, please cite it as below."
title: "deepseek-v41-flash-spark: DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash on a single DGX Spark"
abstract: >-
  A serving recipe and PyTorch/Triton engine that runs the 510 GB DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash checkpoint
  on one 128 GB GB10 (DGX Spark class) box: resident FP4 expert arena with NVMe expert streaming,
  Engram tables read from NVMe, CUDA-graph decode with DSpark speculative decoding, FP8 dense
  projections, and a measured expert-pruning ladder (quality vs speed), all with dated,
  append-only results.
